  "summary": "Vendor deposit follow-up (narrow slice): due date, event date and agreed total (with basis) on vendor_deposits; an append-only reconciliation ledger (proposals, decisions, events); and three functions that make every follow-up edit, proposal and decision atomic with its audit event. Never pays, changes an AP amount, a journal entry or a deposit's status. Creates no data.",
