  "expected_changes": [
    "Adds follow-up columns to vendor_deposits: event_date, balance_due_date (+ basis), agreed_total_cents (+ required basis; an estimate unless quote/contract), project_id. Existing rows keep NULLs; no row changes.",
    "Creates empty append-only tables vendor_deposit_reconciliations, vendor_deposit_reconciliation_decisions and vendor_deposit_events.",
    "Creates vendor_deposit_set_followup, vendor_deposit_propose and vendor_deposit_decide (SECURITY DEFINER, EXECUTE for service_role only): each writes its change and audit event in one transaction with row locks.",
    "Revokes UPDATE/DELETE on vendor_deposits from service_role/authenticated/anon (follow-up edits only through the audited function); service_role keeps SELECT/INSERT. No payment, payable, AP amount or journal entry is created or changed."
  ],
